OL,3,GNEWSAAdult social care services
OL,4,A'improving', council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FImprovements have been made to a local
OL,7,Fauthority's adult social care services
OL,8,Fafter it was told it needed to make
OL,9,Fchanges, it has claimed.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council said
OL,12,Fwaiting times were "falling
OL,13,Fsignificantly" after it was rated
OL,14,F"requires improvement" by the Care
OL,15,FQuality Commission (CQC).
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
