OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAAdult social care services
OL,4,A'improving', council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe CQC assessment, released in
OL,7,FJanuary, found there were long waiting
OL,8,Flists for support equipment and
OL,9,Foccupational therapy services `
OL,10,Fparticularly in rural areas ` and
OL,11,Fpeople had mixed experiences accessing
OL,12,Fcare.
OL,14,FThe council said through its Becoming
OL,15,FBetter Together programme services had
OL,16,Fbeen strengthened, but there was still
OL,17,Fwork to do following the CQC's
OL,18,Fassessment.
